  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dffe31eb988e6581b831620d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これが、\r\nお世話忍法の極意ですね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc9b20cd666c5788308bc904068aaab98fbc096da7b43d11a1c858dced9655de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5ef795ce2265e3e5cc725e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "忍法・お世話の術♪\r\nよ～しよ～し。",
      "source_fingerprint": "679ddbf16919470fb4425c4a94a6a8852dae87edbc0f88f8bac5d13fd46c4489",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ead8545dcfb994665a0e5c16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スーパークリークですよ～。\r\nにんにん♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a555abfc67caf7a38692ad2533457c03c544be17ae3bd91b54d99ff844925653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1045",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d1b5dedf8f2c02228ed569e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c967e75e39f341bde454f3e389531a0943b2e9cb665d31e66635fcd79e310da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c62e71d12129226781dc7a86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要有各位的支援，\n飞鹰子一定能够成为\n顶尖的沙之偶像的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1639055a8420a24141f209f6f86393f70d614864c0af1c8065b99845e7e4811",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b7600e1cd181846a121185f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d87c73674448030810201b02536701821e85b098250d29146354877d722be62e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e46db1254ab513be44adc04c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e05e0d01b97d8e287ed643df53f6aec75f4a5750baabbde30c05707ea450b4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:710f3bb9eb6b2425f30d958c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是飞鹰子『逃掉』的话，\n第一个追上来的粉丝肯定是训练员吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7bd067ab621a95a7518586a466e621c10ec5c9506f6f40a21f824adbac11320",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f251cc0e96cdf0954fd1fd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也要因为飞鹰子的光辉而变得闪闪发光了哦～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cbcec83f2abb6b23c9b39b0e7f6fbc4a9da8381552e060f1c25794159ac5028",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cbf32271f6e2b24f7993b1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐～！\n要是哪天飞鹰子能在什么新年节目里出场的话，\n就想试试看表演『偶像的隐藏秘技』呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "dba2e6633071a9bd7f6e5f40af8046c793b5d58159245c6dc766d3e42659b818",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b42ef3e051b09376b36a3f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子一直都爱着所有粉丝哦！\n所以，训练员也情人节快乐哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "59a9c5e98a4caabe95e4bfb93caedadef04646d533963a6b9f40f6d284fdcd68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a31c3f85c1f74af3025e31c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎嘿嘿……要记得对大家保密哦☆\n这是送给训练员的本命……感谢巧克力哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7e5457a00cbf0f2ed0461e20247600150a77f25d14ff700ac1e31f9a988bc52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d282f225c3a8d9ed83ae104",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想好七夕节的愿望啦！\n希望大家看到闪闪发光的飞鹰子的时候，\n都能露出发自内心的笑容☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0777d5cb063329e18fcc6db174236d79ff17b407d4e60b95178ae837e2d79240",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e389e1053c2c35f92f228ed2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Trick or Live！什么的，\n开玩笑啦……不对呀！\n那要是收到糖果的话，岂不是不能举办Live了？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b20f54959c5d50f0a898466863a1524b3b2d7ba9c06be1a3c4000c3af2ae1fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc728d950ea05e25b39cd59d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞节的彩灯、\n再加上飞鹰子闪闪发光的Live…\n听上去很浪漫呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e78e888cbe3fd18612bd9ee72c8dc3587cd2eee595fa4661019a6de228f9cf35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7bf1e50ded4044df1e76e1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐☆\n今天的话，\n要不要飞鹰子只为了训练员而献唱呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "110e9ad8b2d4c933af9741eb2499d7ff692bcc2157252755fbba0351ca421a39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0afe9c20125fbd750da15caf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢大家的支持！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2f0ec79472b46492fd3e8ded60fde222d4a2e789bf64a346f40f7a46151a894",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:107d31994ab11a47d015ac75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！一起看看年末特别节目吧！\n看看今年会有怎样风格的孩子出场，\n说不定能成为明年的参考哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57d8a8c36a79a798fbefa14bf91ab24de8d32690702df8f74533efc1acd44f00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80dbac853e13db9d2a6ad23d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐♪\n飞鹰子为训练员准备了一首特别的歌作为生日礼物哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cb2c7afca4b39272a2b787cad30f9b2a39ffe1d71047af628419203a7a71917",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d60bb1bd0f3c87b52662a552",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子的第一个粉丝是训练员，真是太好了呢……\n生日快乐哦，训练员☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7d35df9fe664c53fcdfd219fd507edf99ec3ffe733530e7b0c8b00a299fb4e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8083fa2e2a2286bd785a5b64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是飞鹰子的生日哦☆\n纪念Live上该唱什么好呢……\n对了，训练员也要来看哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6975799e444bdae08baa84d5cf98cda435c02ed1479303b757b6e5d3d880a72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b7ff027d129427cc6bf8cc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是明年还是后年……\n都希望训练员是第一个来跟我说新年快乐的人呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "93f131640cea27e853d9eb0f072f969f19dddcf7211b8f8c7c1acc6b4b702272",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b90ceaab53fbef335e0caa10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，有新的通知哦☆\n得快点确认下新的情报呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7609c1ad837d1ec4040176444068671ddd325eb7ba17afdd245ee58a1ba7567d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:002ddacab55ab74797404063",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇～有新的礼物送到了呢～\n会不会是粉丝送的呢？去看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c4574986f7c3ebd323b74498af07b5c1c63617d553e1f6acb7e46f552e14179",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7347ca6e455870eaed0b6195",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成了哦☆\n不管是做马娘偶像还是做训练员，\n最重要的都是踏踏实实地努力呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ffea029ba3bb5ad5a363f67e4183b54e7a20f6b181f7f4460f9af311cfb1abb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0923664a721bb35972f602ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动要开始了哦！\n也许正是马娘偶像的活跃之时了哦！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b851dbaa9d5b5614704bb95304bfffbdbc32ccfd88749d2c33c33022176ec6a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:007999a15d4129df535df61c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始了！\n得让大家都来看看\n飞鹰子闪耀的笑容呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23dc892d93c16cb4b46137c528804a39dd225928e91fc48ae79cd8b105320736",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f9b85aa88caeab7d91c5f3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸，输了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1d7a2f7ae19446f566a96aa13606308632fa1416ad2707fcda4c8c7cbb84d89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4f523c3e28ba54f2123c8b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "马娘名鉴，等级上升♪\n要好好确认一下哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37996abab5ca68a7357cf2821ab4036645adbf9fae7bdda09237eb3027e29269",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1977ee2dc5d9bc7c38aabc71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的便服应该大多会配合\r\n这个发饰来设计穿搭～\r\n……因为这发饰对我来说很重要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f59ed624ad641d7b1f15adbc60c4a4c7411b9e0d8d4ef0d6a0e3e2979f54d08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98facddb803176c11f2a9697",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子家经常要跟着父母调职\r\n搬来搬去！所以……对于各地的\r\n演唱会会场要怎么去，超有信心☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "906d31a50430334ca9be19f8471653c329daace7d8ebef1720d6a778e2c47e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:971a18a996d210ccaeaf7602",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪耀告诉我的那间蛋糕店……\r\n真是好吃……呜……我得忍耐到\r\n下次演唱会结束才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff30b7862f903c1ac38ccc1441dcccf70d135e51060baf58a3e31d12232eca7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43619206c9d6ef36a845fb65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平局了呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c76461d847e1341400ff1dea9c749297812710b7c89947a31679b98438e758af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a6815a85fd76e15cbfebef0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我们的胜利呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dd13b73db794043ac196f1b95e5d48b0e100731a9ae0217a58f8071ad4c1876",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a0f0b3739b07897b1d6cb02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸，输了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1d7a2f7ae19446f566a96aa13606308632fa1416ad2707fcda4c8c7cbb84d89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8241b2b0c85c20287d60e244",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平局了呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c76461d847e1341400ff1dea9c749297812710b7c89947a31679b98438e758af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55f0ed6bebc897c365fbbc9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快看快看，新的最高分哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e5d98b28a8da13cc73ef92a33d06d3b0699eebe42bb82c4c7a247a43dd31fc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:995de7990297d65983023c36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "齐心协力，一起加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e3f38a6dfbbd03d87ecb68d692448fc7034f88217ac3fb7dcf2876ef3235d31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:133927f6c19cec7968398013",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然大家都很可爱呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "43dec3f2f0852e08e467e8903d246648a5b72575e26e0cfd1a1ac72574047a1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1059"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67c9e30f406786df97aada6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "粉丝可不会等我们的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc8ae348a673141221dbef1ac07fbd512751da8fe19be4cb450dee959a614057",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:252f377eba57d540146c0b4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哔哔咻☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "1515812b18811ab82c075247a4c4b3727620448359f39e8ecb7c33c2d2551a39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1097"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68a108fad501d97155e35051",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c967e75e39f341bde454f3e389531a0943b2e9cb665d31e66635fcd79e310da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "1098"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7894e7dc70f52483c38c4bc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b411963e07417cc898fbde67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对马娘偶像而言，训练也很重要哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c8c7329e141fa62a7b2f4ede90522c210b882ad7d3fbb1be4d42fab41689dff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "110000"
      ]
